cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite it as below."
title: "Analysis code for: Context-dependent H3K27me3 remodeling reveals a transitional chromatin state during adipogenic differentiation"
abstract: "Analysis code for a CRR (contiguous repressive region) framework that defines broad H3K27me3 domains from binarised 200-bp genome-wide signal, integrates them with chromatin accessibility and histone modifications, and resolves CRR states by MFA and graph clustering. Input data: GEO GSE346087."
type: software
